    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a4e18c278915b98ca923255",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海の平和もアタシが守る！\r\nペガサス・マリンショーット！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fc65545d9870716570ebc3e5076f993c350d930ff0d0719b98a058d882f3ff2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1435840b7a8656f8d3896ea4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "オマエも、アタシのヒーローだからなっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8b301fe02fb4edbebbddc1df73e7ddd416cb2f1d03fdf88206cc4a6fcba1599",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a434e47328616d9f1150008",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヒーローになる夢、叶えたぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "636f82ef6697cef5bd04cb0fed8b0894fd533d7a13c663a6a9cdbdfb3a2a77b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7f181059bf4d10264277912",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "パワーアーーップ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07e670c410e48305d7f925034a27c16fcb7d61ebac6e11ccdb964e7d1f3da079",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d50733a54c7d01dbfc505bad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ペガサス・エボリューション！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59e70e5b450edcd2891be6f55f40b1f616bee5b3e34380c51d222d0fc6de670c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5138c8e37e52c4e0397abad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ビコーペガサス、見参！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9fd5d4c8c1f276f7dc4af264ab7447afd1fa802321079d027f69c59fe4bbaf8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d346e7e77078474a16acc465",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来救你了！喝！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85cf047b408b2e32c3f7f67964703dc7a298027a083a6e9f900d2433d95be611",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c16ad38bb551cf2384ed0ae0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是！正义的友情力量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb963d925fdfd06abd8658823d7b725daea0eefdf948bea56f2ca697466c1400",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc1d16770031b1f17ab28add",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's go美丽～～☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "b89806ffee746c928d24cf64c68017b3d6ab89039438812bd28b81844a2f794c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70590d3a317d1cd855170f17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟训练员在一起的\r\n今天胜过昨天☆明天胜过今天★\r\n一天比一天更～美丽♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f2a9430e11be5d4e08e1e51de595b5fa1bcdaba104c3d4663e897add313d3a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f914c46d6baa4e93e31843e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いってくるねー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b51033272c04ad190ba91bbd814e76a76418259a713a1880908a02d052e6995",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b37002c4514663be43219f45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9d600edd4c987f3247b3090a622080abe8e88308dcf78eded0477be4bf5d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3eeeca459b214820c19a69a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也去寻找美丽的碎片♪\r\n搜集许许多多的美丽，\r\n打造出特大的美丽吧☆★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "8643d6ccbaab495181508d99bbb36d354b54380433bac0b72b0c23ec0ef25888",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22485dc3dc2ca20b1d1ca795",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也一起要一起～？……美丽☆\r\n啊哈！跟训练员同步了☆\r\n感觉自己无所不能呢★",
      "source_fingerprint": "a100763bb5963af6aeb1eef02f4e737219bd11fa19c21a92c6306e27f0b2987a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9edb3a26caeac354d5e99b1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "亮晶晶的金黄色♪爸爸的\r\n特制美味伊达卷闪闪发光光～♪\r\n所以跟我一起吃吧？好吗☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "08a6e791d50638fcd3ea94ae405fa792baec847a497415bf6b96c5c813ef9419",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73ffaa667a226b72b44b646e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好开心♪好开心♪收到素质特制的\r\n搞怪巧克力好开心♪我要做\r\n柿种花生巧克力当作回礼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10cfbc549f9657054b205505256c12b1c1ae848d718dabd18ba71a1dd88d5308",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b19bcb475daa1305a83b50e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给训练员特制款！这是送给\r\n散播美丽之人的认可巧克力☆\r\n我们世界今天也很美丽★",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec952be5264a683e9182173f4d5597c5ef2f43924ba97cad806d75928731859",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc627e91da0b8d24568a6c59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪耀动人～☆★☆★\r\n这是今年的七夕之舞！\r\n我准备要去跳给奶奶看♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad93a8bf5837d1b72bb43880d7d16180234e4b75bd03324acef752db413fe256",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c16a41b8664ea7d1a8d981be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恶魔之门要开了☆地点在哪里呢★\r\n是在广场？仓库？还是教室？\r\n怦然心动！紧张刺激！真是美丽☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "df7bdec800a169d82b2b8a14ed95037db574b393f64e57f86a0cdbd9d8f4c2c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d8034376ddbd54df677ef6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到圣诞节就想到袜子！\r\n爸爸为我编织的袜子是我的宝物！\r\n有这～么大唷☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad7c51779b7b4f49a01e66be190ed4b69d22fe215189479938973aadb18fb133",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffd9459cd2580c6c11ebc0c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞美丽老人登场☆★☆\r\n闪耀动人的灯海，雀跃无比的料理！\r\n全～都献给训练员★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c62aaa3365fe29b56f3d8e089ae5512a97d2fb99d65d5fd650e61d445f346f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee3afc5165c1d5141b1ef686",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大～家都很美丽☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "872c35202aceb068c0049d5f954145f8089b4092bb1c2e55eb845c1e3c730018",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26645d56442ec39f62debd28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈，跨年的重要工作好忙碌～☆\r\n要在年糕上迭橘子♪摆放门松、\r\n扇子、注连绳！恭迎年神～★☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "d640535e7f33d2e04651a8a1d308cd43ccc0bcc9f4aa36d9dd224e87a1bddd38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba33ca3c34e451f8687ec419",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日到了！必须举办派对☆\r\n一定要准备全套飨宴★\r\n来个闪耀动人的惊喜庆祝！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58616fb3c396c6a541670fb002ce02cefd3d74993016bcd1755afdc4ce46738c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a36e886c16cd0acf5725a439",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你诞生到这个世界上！\r\n很高兴你至今为止都过得充满活力，\r\n并恭喜你有个美好的明天在等待着☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "936736eda9ca9e50683afd633dfd28600b7f5c6f737c975fd4aabb03ce459489",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3b4e5148985f9394ce30dfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想要的礼物是……训练员☆★\r\n毕竟生日就是要与家人以及重要的人\r\n一起度过☆尽情放开来玩吧★☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3a6f63c58e3ee63849fba888ee7dd3d21cabaefb7ae6d311dd084c8f4dff53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a5591467cc51d71f2af072e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新的我☆诞生了！！\r\n与你共度的每一天，都是造就\r\n新的我的养分！所以谢谢你★☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "31553f584074a58b0e3526a524b51f42c79962d2cdf033acdbeea3ed614fd365",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db2b086449c9b3b7154a4667",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到新的公告啰！\r\n我有预感能碰上新的邂逅☆★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f4a0f79f14ca5eb5c164d768b6e73e02f3c71bd511422ad3ce233483529f789",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16535f092b16fc3cc6a10f9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "礼物送到了哦！\r\n为每天小小的特别献上双倍感谢☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "0899f26ac7f80244b81062a7d4986a95bde9227e216681b8779341224c123bd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a85106598feeecd339e44e36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成☆\r\n你总是如此努力，真美丽★",
      "source_fingerprint": "c32f73e65a5e57d2cdefefb4bdaa953a77593412d3f49fd23aec5bbbe6cd3b37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37eaaa46ecd1033f7eefaa90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要准备活动啦☆\r\n把望远镜放进包包，带上捕虫网，\r\n出发去搜集好多限定的美丽啰★",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d9f208da7d441e127ab21cb9b720679269a86277d03ad4411496bb56c96ef6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58b3cac0b277e60f4f7de6af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美丽～～☆★☆★\r\n活动开始，快去捕捉\r\n与雀跃无比的邂逅吧☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae2de1263296c01fe22419f59d078050ff100b2b8d97a4122c2e7b66d9686dc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d0f521cd9aba0b19b5d75ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次还有机会☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "80ae2ed05575d2d26d0e011b3680c5a349def062393cd9ab6f226853cf2b9d3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdcdc475ed02054a5f08b6ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇～名册等级提升了！\r\n完成了好多项目呢☆★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "074fd9ed65d15310d93a2ab0393e427de87f5c627c84100d9bd4f9d457c417f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
